an absolute path under nimoi, or a path relative to nimoi. Returns up to 2000 lines from `offset` (1-based) and `next_offset` (null at the end), plus the file's sha256 (needed to replace a file with mcp__fs__write).","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer","default":1},"limit":{"type":"integer","default":2000}},"required":["path"]}},{"type":"function","name":"search","description":"Search text files for a regular expression, under a directory within your fs.read (default: the nimoi root). `glob` filters file names (e.g. \"*.md\"). Excluded directories are skipped and listed as pruned; .git and caches are skipped. At most 200 matches.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"glob":{"type":"string"},"ignore_case":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},"required":["pattern"]}}]},{"type":"namespace","name":"ledger","description":"Harness ledger tools, bounded by ledger.read and ledger.write.","tools":[{"type":"function","name":"read","description":"Read one ledger name, or one exact revision by `id`. For a name: its current body, id, author and labels; set history for every earlier body. `bound` is true when the name has ever been written (it then has a `current` entry); labels alone do not bind a name. `deleted` is true when the current body is a deletion (null). `current.prev` is the id that write replaced (null for a first write). For an id: that revision, and whether it is still current.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string"},"history":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"max_chars":{"type":"integer","default":20000}}}},{"type":"function","name":"list","description":"List ledger names, optionally filtered by name prefix and/or label. Harness records are under log/<session>/ and carry the labels 'harness', 'log.<kind>' and 'agent.<id>'. Message text is its own entry labelled 'log.text' (body = the text, author = its writer); the 'message' record that follows links to it as [[name]].","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"prefix":{"type":"string","default":""},"label":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer","default":100}}}}]}]}}}}
