{"ts":"2026-09-29T12:40:10.341Z","author":"harness:claude-anthropic-harness/task-6-hybrid","name":"log/20260929T123834Z/000386","body":{"kind":"tool_call","agent":"governor","turn":2,"phase":"post","tool_use_id":"toolu_01TFZo3we6U6wgkq1QJynEuH","tool_name":"mcp__ledger__read","tool_response":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n \"ledger\": \"claude-anthropic-harness-t6\",\n \"name\": \"work/gpt-owner/task6-summary\",\n \"labels\": [\n  \"agent.owner.2\",\n  \"completed\",\n  \"owner\",\n  \"summary\",\n  \"task6\"\n ],\n \"bound\": true,\n \"deleted\": false,\n \"current\": {\n  \"id\": \"20260929T123834Z:1407\",\n  \"ts\": \"2026-09-29T12:40:02.341Z\",\n  \"author\": \"owner.2@20260929T123834Z:gpt-5.6-sol@claude-anthropic-harness\",\n  \"prev\": null,\n  \"body\": \"Bar: Produce a short, plain, source-faithful account that captures task 6’s inherited harness baseline, three layers, model restrictions, responsibilities, UI, and escalation mechanism without adding requirements.\\n\\nSummary: Task 6 asks each swimlane to turn its task-5 harness into a hybrid Claude/GPT harness, retaining the earlier logging, UI, per-session ledger, bounded filesystem and Python tools, write/execute separation, and harness-owned bounded-subagent capabilities. It should reuse work from other swimlanes for the model lineage not previously implemented. The architecture has three layers: a Claude Opus-only governor that talks with the human and dispatches work without taking over or broadly grading it; task owners using Claude Opus/Fable or GPT Astra/Sol that are accountable for task quality, instruction compliance, and NIMOI faithfulness; and strictly subordinate subagents using Claude Sonnet-or-higher or GPT Terra-or-higher. The UI centers direct conversation with governance while exposing other agents’ activity, and task owners can make justified, self-blocking requests to governance for actions beyond their authority.\\n\\nChecked: Read /bootstrap-harness/rules.md in full; task 5 is at lines 69–84 and task 6 at lines 89–98. The delegated first draft was checked against those passages.\\n\\nStatus: completed.\"\n }\n}"}]}}
